                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-4 text-center">
                    <div class="mb-4">
                        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 text-2xl">
                            <i class="fas fa-download"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-800 text-lg mb-1" id="modalProductTitleBody">Product Files &amp; Tutorial</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Download the required application and watch the complete installation tutorial.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="d-grid gap-3">
                        <a id="modalSetupVideoBtn" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-danger py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-sm">
                            <i class="fab fa-youtube text-lg"></i>
                            <span>Watch Setup Video</span>
                        </a>

                        <a id="modalApkDownloadBtn" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-success py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-sm" style="background-color: #008c09; border-color: #008c09;">
                            <i class="fas fa-file-arrow-down text-lg"></i>
                            <span>Download APK / File</span>
                        </a>

                        <a id="modalFeedbackBtn" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-sm" style="background-color: #0284c7; border-color: #0284c7;">
                            <i class="fab fa-telegram text-lg"></i>
                            <span>Join Discussion &amp; Feedback</span>
                        </a>

                        <div id="modalEmptyNotice" style="display: none;" class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 text-slate-600 text-xs text-center font-medium">
                            <i class="fas fa-info-circle text-cyan-600 mr-1.5"></i> এই প্রোডাক্টের জন্য কোনো লিংক বা ফাইল প্রয়োজন নেই।
